<description>&lt;p&gt;President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud faced a court rejection of his term extension, after which armed forces seized the Supreme Court and threatened its chief. Somali security forces opened fire on protesters in Mogadishu, killing at least three civilians, while separate police shootings killed two civilians. Government troops were attacked near Leego town, and the Somali police deputy chief warned of a security vacuum as Ugandan troops withdraw. Egypt, Somalia and Djibouti held talks reaffirming their exclusive role in securing the Red Sea waterway. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPUmllbzMwVHdYMDFXSFlQejBkNnlLOXRjRExHOU40b1J2dkFjOGpFSFg4WVJBUFppWkZDcGprTXNRRWt5VkF0Sm9TR2dPa0RkbjI2QmpNVVEwUUJnUk55YVQtYVJFbEJCM3ZMQUJGY2dIR1MyMUVZRWVxaW40VW9XcGoySUVuTUhRRE1zUGc3eUtQekVYUEpz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Star Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOMjVoRW0wWkZOaUdpbUNZSVZROE16XzlsMl9qZGpNdFhjQnFHSmtTMm1SSjU4elBSRDRnRlNsN21ISXAtaUlBZ1lUanJTRkRxd1pSN3JuR2xUX2pKZ1M1aWZnSnpfUFhadDk3a3BldDN3c1hkdG5aYU45OWJub2habTUxdGVLSXpCZ1A0WE16S2NyV2h2SEItWTJfQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawan Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxQalQ0WGNrVjJCT1loUllTajVxLS1yWnJVZHJZeDh6UUc4aS1zb1lHMzJucXFJdmpHZnY2UGtMX1JRMWRGSlpKQ1kwWFEzZ2plVWE5cnp5RHJFREE4X0l0Y3l0MGRZcVlPNDF4aWIxV3BFMElwaWx3M3hzR2FFbTUzeXVhT1ZRVlAySV9US1F5RWthX0VJb0NoOTlTclVWSklMT0dBOS1NcHZmblFRMWpGUWFVV1JPa3Y4SVEwVFYtQXc4U04w?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;